flowchart TD
    Start([Job Received from Queue]) --> LoadWorkflow[Load workflow.md<br/>from Process Repo]

    LoadWorkflow --> ValidateWorkflow{Workflow Valid?}
    ValidateWorkflow -->|No| FailJob[Update Job Status: Failed<br/>Reason: Invalid workflow]
    ValidateWorkflow -->|Yes| InitContext[Initialize Execution Context<br/>Load schemas, patterns, config]

    InitContext --> PhaseLoop{More Phases?}

    PhaseLoop -->|Yes| GetPhase[Get Next Phase<br/>step-0X-*.md]
    PhaseLoop -->|No| AllPhasesComplete[All Phases Complete]

    GetPhase --> ExecutePhase[Execute Phase Operations<br/>Delegate to Process Service]

    ExecutePhase --> CheckTimeout{Execution<br/>Timeout?}
    CheckTimeout -->|Yes| SaveCheckpoint[Save Checkpoint<br/>to Artifact Storage]
    SaveCheckpoint --> RestartPhase[Restart Phase from Checkpoint]
    RestartPhase --> ExecutePhase

    CheckTimeout -->|No| PhaseComplete[Phase Operations Complete]

    PhaseComplete --> CollectArtifacts[Collect Generated Artifacts<br/>YAML, diagrams, ADRs]

    CollectArtifacts --> ValidateArtifacts{Artifacts<br/>Valid?}
    ValidateArtifacts -->|No| ArtifactError[Log Validation Errors]
    ArtifactError --> GateLocked

    ValidateArtifacts -->|Yes| RunCounterChecks[Run Counter-Checks<br/>Grounding, Coherence, Phantom Hunt]

    RunCounterChecks --> EvaluateGate[Evaluate Gate Conditions<br/>GATE_N]

    EvaluateGate --> GateStatus{Gate Status?}

    GateStatus -->|LOCKED| GateLocked[Update Job: gate_locked<br/>Send Webhook Notification]
    GateLocked --> ManualIntervention{Manual<br/>Override?}
    ManualIntervention -->|Yes| PhaseLoop
    ManualIntervention -->|No| FailJob

    GateStatus -->|OPEN| StorePhaseArtifacts[Store Phase Artifacts<br/>to Object Storage]

    StorePhaseArtifacts --> UpdateProgress[Update Job Progress<br/>current_phase++]

    UpdateProgress --> PhaseLoop

    AllPhasesComplete --> GenerateFinalReport[Generate Final Report<br/>verification-report.yaml]

    GenerateFinalReport --> StoreFinalArtifacts[Store All Final Artifacts]

    StoreFinalArtifacts --> UpdateJobComplete[Update Job Status: Completed]

    UpdateJobComplete --> SendWebhook[Send Completion Webhook]

    SendWebhook --> DeleteFromQueue[ACK Message<br/>Delete from Queue]

    DeleteFromQueue --> End([Job Complete])

    FailJob --> MoveToDLQ[NACK Message<br/>Move to DLQ]
    MoveToDLQ --> End

    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style End fill:#FFB6C1
    style FailJob fill:#FF6B6B
    style GateLocked fill:#FFA500
    style EvaluateGate fill:#87CEEB
    style UpdateJobComplete fill:#90EE90
